	// MECHANISM-1: Quadratic penalty 0.35*qdDiff^2 creates sharp differentiation between loaded and unloaded instances; the linear penalty was REFUTED as too weak (score dropped from -3925 to -4471)
	// EXPECT-1: combined_score > -3950

